ulldog","shared_categories":"Beer, Food, Restaurants, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-e03PAS1YpMAaxp86Hau7A","review_id":"abx1sBk0dKzR7PFHgGj9Pg","date":"2014-11-21T08:30:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8904334306716919,"text_excerpt":"Martin's is a first-rate wine merchant. They offer a wide selection of wines from around the world. They were patient and helpful as I was first learning about the complex world of wine. They also cater to the mouth-swishing, eye-rolling, soft-moaning wine aficionados who travel with portable breath-o-lycées. My occasional requests to order a vintage find of one of my friends, yields a larger-eyed \"Are You Sure? We CAN Do That!?!?\" That gently informs me that I don't want to. Martin's also carries a wide selection of beers. You have to go to their Metairie store for other spirits. Martins offers courses and wine workshops for newbies. Martins has recovered gracefully from having their ear..."},{"business_id":"-e03PAS1YpMAaxp86Hau7A","review_id":"YT6H0_oiwGA5D64b_ZMRBw","date":"2013-10-12T20:10:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8676419258117676,"text_excerpt":"This is the best place to buy booze and get a great sandwich. I got the roast beef deluxe with Gator Tatters and it was delicious."},{"business_id":"-e03PAS1YpMAaxp86Hau7A","review_id":"vAmWRhvnJEdlQMTHGT5AMg","date":"2011-08-25T16:48:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8643959164619446,"text_excerpt":"In my book, Martin's isn't an everyday stop. I reserve this for my last-ditch alcohol efforts, after I comb through Rouses and Williams for my fancy-pants bottles of quality booze. To wit: I had a limited Christmas budget, but I didn't want my gifts to look cheap to the untrained eye. Off to Martin's we go! I looked confused, and a staffer stepped up within seconds. Whoohoo! I had $25 in my pocket to make my brother think he was getting a \"very ritzy\" Christmas gift, and the staffer understood. He pointed to several bottles with good pedigree that fit my budget, explaining the relative merits of each in a nutshell. I had his full attention, and he managed to solve my problem in less than ..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
